---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const services = [{n:'01',name:'Air conditioning',text:'Find your comfort zone. Installation and climate solutions for your home or business.',url:'/services/air-conditioning/',icon:'❄'},{n:'02',name:'Refrigeration',text:'Keep your cool where it counts. Refrigeration installation, servicing and repairs.',url:'/services/refrigeration/',icon:'◫'},{n:'03',name:'Service & repairs',text:'Give your system the attention it needs. Maintenance and repairs for better everyday performance.',url:'/services/servicing/',icon:'↻'}];
---
<Layout title="Air Conditioning & Refrigeration in Malmesbury | ACSAR" description="ACSAR installs, services and repairs air conditioning and refrigeration systems in Malmesbury, Cape Town and surrounding Western Cape areas. Discuss your project with us.">
<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> YOUR LOCAL CLIMATE SPECIALISTS</p><h1>Good air.<br/>Cool spaces.<br/><em>All year round.</em></h1><p class="intro">Air conditioning and refrigeration, taken care of. Installation, servicing and repairs in Malmesbury, Cape Town and surrounding areas.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s talk comfort <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore our services <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span class="location-pin">⌖</span><span>Local expertise. A personal approach.<br/><strong>Malmesbury, Cape Town & surrounds</strong></span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="/climate-room.svg" alt="Illustrated sunlit interior with a wall-mounted air conditioner and views of the Western Cape landscape" width="760" height="850" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="image-label"><span class="pulse"></span> A LITTLE MORE COMFORT.</div><div class="comfort-card"><span class="snow">❄</span><div><strong>Comfort comes home.</strong><small>Whatever the season.</small></div><span>↗</span></div><span class="visual-caption">DESIGNED FOR YOUR SPACE. CARED FOR BY ACSAR.</span></div></section>
<div class="service-strip"><div class="container"><span>INSTALLATION</span><i>✳</i><span>SERVICING</span><i>✳</i><span>REPAIRS</span><i>✳</i><span>MAINTENANCE</span><i>✳</i><span>VENTILATION</span></div></div>
<section class="section container" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p><h2>The right climate.<br/>The right people.</h2></div><p>From a cooler home to refrigeration that works for your business, we help you look after the systems you rely on.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map(s=><a class="service-card" href={s.url}><div class="card-top"><span class="service-icon">{s.icon}</span><span>{s.n} /</span></div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><span class="card-link">Explore service <span>↗</span></span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="about" id="about"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="about-mark"><span>❄</span><strong>Cool heads.<br/>Warm service.</strong><small>YOUR SPACE. OUR CARE.</small></div><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET ACSAR</p><h2>Local service.<br/>Lasting comfort.</h2><p>We’re Advanced Climate Systems and Refrigeration — ACSAR for short. Based in Malmesbury, we install, service and repair air conditioning, refrigeration and ventilation systems.</p><p>Every space has different needs. Whether you’re planning an installation or looking after an existing system, start with a conversation about what works for yours.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Tell us what you need <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section container area-grid" id="areas"><div><p class="eyebrow">CLOSE TO HOME</p><h2>From Malmesbury.<br/>For our community.</h2><p class="body-copy">Based in the heart of the Swartland, close to Cape Town, we work in Malmesbury, Cape Town and surrounding areas. Tell us where you’re based so we can confirm availability for your property.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Check your area <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="area-art"><div class="map-line one"></div><div class="map-line two"></div><div class="map-line three"></div><span class="map-town cape">CAPE TOWN</span><span class="map-town swart">SWARTLAND</span><div class="map-marker"><span>⌖</span><strong>Malmesbury</strong><small>OUR HOME BASE</small></div><span class="map-note">WESTERN CAPE, SOUTH AFRICA · ILLUSTRATIVE MAP</span></div></section>
<section class="faq-section container"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW HELPFUL ANSWERS</p><h2>Let’s clear the air.</h2><details><summary>Can you help with a new aircon installation?</summary><p>Yes. ACSAR offers air conditioning installation. Share your room size, property type and requirements so we can discuss a suitable system.</p></details><details><summary>Do you service existing air conditioners?</summary><p>Yes. We offer servicing, maintenance and repairs. Tell us the make and model of your system and describe any issues you have noticed.</p></details><details><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><p>We are based in Malmesbury and work in surrounding areas. Contact us with your location to confirm whether we can assist.</p></details><details><summary>What should I include when requesting a quote?</summary><p>Include your location, the service you need and a few details about the space or existing unit. Photos of the unit and model label can also help.</p></details></section>
<section class="cta container"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMFORT STARTS WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Let’s get your space<br/>feeling just right.</h2></div><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Get in touch <span>↗</span></a></section>
</Layout>
